    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36692" root="كثر" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُثَارٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِيرٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِثَارٌ</span></b> , <i>Companies,</i> or <i>troops,</i> or <i>the like,</i> (K, TA,) of men
or animals only. (TA.) You say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى الدَّارِ كُثَارٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنَ النَّاسِ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِثَارٌ</span>, <i>In the house are companies
of men.</i> (TA.)

